Sometimes while looking for a solution for an existing problem we will find out someone else did it before so we would be able to find
a solution within someone else's code.
The first Design pattern we will talk about is Factory- In case we need to make a brand new instance so other classes will be using this
we will make a factory specifically for this, he will create the instances and deal with them so other classes will deal with the program to interface
while it deals with the implementation.
when a change will occur in the list of changes the factory will need to change but only him!
In other words its a class that is a convention to use and to produce new items with.

